<title>FRANCE: Essilor Q1 sales up 24 percent.</title>
<headline>Essilor Q1 sales up 24 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover					 2,192    vs    1,768</p>
<p>NOTE - Essilor International Compagnie Generale d'Optique SA said in a statement that the 24 percent rise included a 4.6 percent positive currency impact and an 18.6 percent gain of the first-time consolidation of U.S. prescription lens laboratories.</p>
<p>On a like-for-like basis the sales would have been 0.8 percent higher on the previous year period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
